nager. Men & Women's Swimming Assistant Coach Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Men's-Women's Swimming The University of Mary Washington, an NCAA Division III institution located in historic and vibrant Fredericksburg, VA, is seeking a part time assistant coach for men's and women's swimming. Position may be renewed on a yearly basis at discretion of Head Coach. Graduate tuition remission may be possible after one year of employment. Coaching Athletic Assistant duties include, but are not limited to, assisting the head coach with practice and meet preparation and coaching, recruiting, academics, fundraising, and the off-season program planning along with transportation of athletes to and from off-site practice and competition sites. Hear about jobs that are right for you? Sign up for job alerts Job Alert fbcab6bc Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments Registrar's Office Registrar's Office Categories Student Employment Student Employment Employment Type Student Employee Student Employee First Name (required) 36bfc1b8 Last Name (required) cebe4a83 Email (required) 1c171102 Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Candidate Details Please choose the employment type(s)"
