aintaining a beautiful and inviting university. Contracts & Resourcing Manager Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Capital Outlay The University of Mary Washington has an exciting opportunity to join our team as a Contracts & Resourcing Manager. Hear about jobs that are right for you? Sign up for job alerts Job Alert b8290af3 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments University Police/Public Safety University Police/Public Safety Categories Staff Staff Employment Type Full Time Full Time First Name (required) 93ca4b42 Last Name (required) e1a501fc Email (required) 473d58f9 Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Candidate Details Please choose the employment type(s)"
