lp plan events, and represent STARS at campus and community programs. This role provides an opportunity to connect with prospective and current students, share your UMW experience, and serve as a positive representative of the university. Grounds Lead Worker Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Grounds Support the Landscape & Grounds mission of maintaining the UMW landscape & grounds in a safe, neat, clean and aesthetically pleasing manner. The UMW Landscape & Grounds Department strives to provide exceptional service and a safe environment to the UMW community and visitors, while being an environmental steward in maintaining a beautiful and inviting university. Contracts & Resourcing Manager Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Capital Outlay The University of Mary Washington has an exciting opportunity to join our team as a Contracts & Resourcing Manager. Hear about jobs that are right for you? Sign up for job alerts Job Alert ba65fc55 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments Center for Continuing & Professional Studies Center for Continuing & Professional Studies Categories Teaching (Instructional) Faculty Teaching (Instructional) Faculty Employment Type Teaching Faculty Teaching Faculty First Name (required) 6ec58802 Last Name (required) b914cf35 Email (required) 5b10f332 Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Candidate Details Please choose the employment type(s)"
